From d079df0b9ce1f705da2c568e6721327e87ae0d63 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ash Pera <ashley.pera@noaa.gov>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 16:38:55 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1/8] noahmpdrv: hand the atmosphere the water Noah-MP removed,
 not latent heat / con_hvap

The CCPP driver gave the atmosphere evap = latent heat / density /
con_hvap (2.5e6 J/kg), but Noah-MP removes the water with its own latent
heats (hvap = 2.5104e6; hsub = 2.844e6 whenever ground or canopy is frozen).
The atmosphere received 0.4 % more water than unfrozen land lost and 14 %
more over frozen surfaces.

Pass the water flux Noah-MP computes, (ecan + etran + edir)/density, as
NCAR's own Noah-MP drivers (WRF, HRLDAS, MPAS, LIS) already do. Over glacier,
set canopy evaporation and transpiration to 0 instead of `undefined`
(9.99e20), since they now enter the flux; ccpp-physics ufs/dev already sets
them to 0. The NUOPC driver converts evap to W/m2 for history and back
before coupling with the same factor, so the coupled flux needs no change;
its history field evap (labelled latent heat) is now this water flux times
density and con_hvap, which differs from Noah-MP's own latent heat over
frozen surfaces. Noah-MP's latent heat itself is unchanged.

Port of ufs-community/ccpp-physics fix D, measured in UFS (C96
control_p8_ugwpv1, in-model meters): the atmosphere received +0.07 to
+0.10 % of global precipitation more water than the land lost; with the fix
the two agree to machine precision.

Measured with the rest of this series in the land component
(datm_cdeps_lnd_gswp3, 24 h, a water meter in noahmpdrv_run): Noah-MP's
water-check residual summed over land points was -1.50 mm (-5.2e-4 of the
precipitation, one-signed) before the series and -2.3e-9 mm (-8e-13) after;
the metered original reproduces the regression baseline.

AI-assisted: written with Claude Code (Anthropic); reviewed by the author.
---
 drivers/ccpp/noahmpdrv.F90 | 7 ++++---
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/ccpp/noahmpdrv.F90 b/drivers/ccpp/noahmpdrv.F90
index eaf9eb6..3fc6571 100644
--- a/drivers/ccpp/noahmpdrv.F90
+++ b/drivers/ccpp/noahmpdrv.F90
@@ -1225,8 +1225,8 @@ end subroutine noahmpdrv_timestep_init
         soil_carbon_fast       = undefined
         leaf_area_index        = undefined
         stem_area_index        = undefined
-        evaporation_canopy     = undefined
-        transpiration          = undefined
+        evaporation_canopy     = 0.0
+        transpiration          = 0.0
         aquifer_water          = undefined
         precip_adv_heat_total  = undefined
         soil_moisture_wtd      = 0.0
@@ -1565,7 +1565,8 @@ end subroutine noahmpdrv_timestep_init
 !  --- change units for output
 !
       hflx(i) = hflx(i) / density / con_cp
-      evap(i) = evap(i) / density / con_hvap
+      ! the water Noah-MP removed (its own hvap/hsub), not latent heat / con_hvap
+      evap(i) = (ecan(i) + etran(i) + edir(i)) / density
 
 !
 !  --- calculate potential evaporation using noah code
